WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.031
Do you like flowers?

2
00:00:02.032 --> 00:00:04.983
What is your favorite flower?

3
00:00:04.984 --> 00:00:07.781
I like tulips.

4
00:00:07.782 --> 00:00:11.182
We went to the flower festival last week.

5
00:00:11.183 --> 00:00:13.947
It was beautiful!

6
00:00:13.948 --> 00:00:17.159
Bada: Can we go on the

7
00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.085
merry-go-round? Mom: Not today,

8
00:00:19.086 --> 00:00:22.279
Bada. Today, we are going to see the flowers.

9
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:23.602
Hana: Come on, Bada!

10
00:00:23.603 --> 00:00:26.242
Let's go look at the tulips! Bada:

11
00:00:26.243 --> 00:00:31.942
But I want to go on the merry-go-round. Hana:

12
00:00:31.943 --> 00:00:37.072
Oh, take a picture of me in front of the tulips, please.

13
00:00:37.073 --> 00:00:44.025
Mom: Where is Bada? Bada? Bada?

14
00:00:44.026 --> 00:00:49.627
Dad: Did you know there are over 30,000 flowers here?

15
00:00:49.628 --> 00:00:53.692
Mom: Honey, let's find Bada first.

16
00:00:53.693 --> 00:00:55.754
Dad: Oh, right. Sorry.

17
00:00:55.755 --> 00:01:05.535
Bada! Bada! He can't be too far away. Bada! Bada! Hana:

18
00:01:05.536 --> 00:01:09.424
Wait! I think I know where he is.

19
00:01:09.425 --> 00:01:11.726
Mom: Bada! Bad boy!

20
00:01:11.727 --> 00:01:13.771
You made us worry. Bada:

21
00:01:13.772 --> 00:01:20.810
I’m sorry. But I wanted to see the merry-go-round. Hana:

22
00:01:20.811 --> 00:01:25.027
Bada, we can go on the rides later. Bada:

23
00:01:25.028 --> 00:01:27.436
Promise? Hana:

24
00:01:27.437 --> 00:01:31.799
Promise. Now let's go see more flowers. Bada:

25
00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:38.099
I’m sorry, Mom and Dad!

26
00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:42.632
After that, even Bada enjoyed the flowers.

27
00:01:42.633 --> 00:01:46.904
Of course we went back to the park to ride the merry-go-round.

28
00:01:46.905 --> 00:01:50.344
So everyone was happy.

